        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Stretch - weblink
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <h3>Other legislation</h3>
<p>There are many other acts of legislation that cover various aspects of cybercrime and offer legal protection such as,  The Forgery and Counterfeiting Act (1981) covers fake items are for sale online and the Identity Documents act (2010) for fake identity documents. Action Fraud is the UK's national reporting centre for fraud and cybercrime and more details are available from them.</p>
<p>For more information on which different acts and legislation that may relate to cyber crime cick on the icon to the right.</p>

